> Error in fun(...):
>     GDAL Error 1: libgrass_I.so cannot open shared object file: No such file
> or directory

Easy to fix:

- become "root" user
- create /etc/ld.so.conf.d/grass.conf
- content: path to GRASS libraries
- save and run
   ldconfig
- exit from "root"

then it should work.

Markus
